Were now on a mission to hire a Recruiter who will help stay ahead of industry trends so we can keep providing exceptional results every time!
It will be a perfect fit if:

• You have 1+ year experience in recruitment;

• You have experience of working remotely;

• You have excellent spoken and written communication skills in English;

• You have experience of working with modern recruiting programs and tools;

• You are a results-oriented person;

• You have natural ability to make things happen and get stuff done. ‍

Your tasks will include: ‍

